text:
Subject : XXXX XXXX Wells Fargo for XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXXXXXX XXXX % XXXX Offer : I originally opened the Wells Fargo XXXX XXXX card based on promotional advertising for a 0 % introductory XXXX period. In addition, I later received a direct promotional letter from Wells Fargo offering 0 % APR for XXXX months on the same credit card account. Based on these representations and offers sent directly to me, I reasonably believed my account qualified for promotional financing terms. 

In response, Wells Fargo stated that, according to their terms and conditions, customers may not be eligible for introductory APRs if they have opened a Wells Fargo XXXX XXXX card within the past XXXX months, even if that account is now closed. 

Amount of interest charged : {$1300.00}
